76044d4cba35244befd84263708dc7 3x"}, "body": "Hello again!\n\nI hope you don't mind if I make yet another request, I genuinely love your art and I can't help it, haha. It's almost my friend's birthday, so I felt the need to get him something nice!\n\nHe doesn't have any art of his characters of a human, so I was wondering if you would be alright working off of a furry reference and simply draw him AS a human? That would be awesome if so! The same goes for my character, I don't have any human art of him yet so if you could draw him as a human as well, that would be awesome!\n\nAgain, if you could draw them with size difference, that would be great! Ideally, something wholesome and cute, with my character as the giant and my friend's character as the tiny.\n\nHere's my character:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/777980988844146738/873712671319523338/cl1-col.jpg\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/777980988844146738/873712689183088700/cl2-col.jpg\n\nHere's my friend's character (the red/black character):\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6SNOrjXIAc92ZT?format=jpg&name=4096x4096\n\nYou're also free to design my friend's clothing as you see fit!\n\nThank you so much and I look forward to hearing back from you!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kuruk89/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 765879, "client_id": 508654, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9113183e66929189e944a111ce17fa23", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9113183e66929189e944a111ce17fa23, https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63